  "rule": "Every officer is expected to know the Space Force's structure. These organization acronyms are accepted across all boards: they are approved (AFPC 'organizations' category) and need no Sec X definition, but only when used with the listed meaning (e.g. SDA = Space Development Agency here; SDA = Space Domain Awareness is a separate CFC Att 1 entry). Update when the structure changes (units are created, merged, or renamed).",
